{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f2bec5e1-908f-8aa5-8e58-3347f1366c63",
  "created_at": "2026-03-08T14:47:51-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rafael Figueroa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:42:01-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine. City Hall's closed today, so you've reached the weekend line. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:42:12-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. This is Rafael Figueroa. I know it's Sunday and you're not at the regular office, so I figured this was the number for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:42:25-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, this is the one. What's going on, Mr. Figueroa?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:42:31-04:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the street in front of my house is a pond. From the rain that ended yesterday. It's still sitting there. Cars come through and they throw a wake, a real one, up onto the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:42:49-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh boy. Okay. What street is that on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:42:54-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ayrault Street. I'm at 280."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:42:57-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "280 Ayrault Street, up on the Hill. Got it. And the water's in the roadway, not in your house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:43:07-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the street. Not in the house. I'm calling for the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:43:14-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Is it right in front of your place, or does it stretch down the block?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:43:23-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly in front of mine and a little bit past. Maybe the length of two cars. It's deep enough that people slow way down and then it sloshes anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:43:38-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Has it gone down at all since yesterday, or is it about the same?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:43:46-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little lower than last night. Not much. It's Sunday afternoon and there's still plenty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:43:54-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you know if there's a drain near there, and whether it's covered with leaves or anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:44:04-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's one at the curb. I can see the top of the grate, barely. There's some leaves on it, yes. I didn't go out and mess with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:44:18-04:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's smart, don't go in the road. I'll put it down as a clogged or slow storm drain at 280 Ayrault. [pause] Let me read it back. Standing water in the street in front of 280, drain at the curb with debris, still holding water the day after the rain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:44:43-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:44:46-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Have you got any pictures?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:44:49-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do. I took a few yesterday and another this morning. I can send them if somebody gives me where to send them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:45:01-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note that you have photos. Someone from the department will follow up and tell you where to send them. Can I get a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:45:14-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0157."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:45:17-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0157. And that's a good number today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:45:21-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I'm home. I'm on the speakerphone, so if I sound far away, that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:45:29-04:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're coming through fine. Now, you asked who to call, and this is the right place. I can't tell you exactly when a crew gets out there, since they're working through a list after the rain. But it goes on the list tonight and they'll look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:45:53-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. And that's the same people who'd come check the drain itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:46:00-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Public Works handles the drains. They'd look at whether it's blocked or whether there's something wrong underneath."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:46:10-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I was going to try City Hall tomorrow but I didn't want to wait. I expect you'd rather hear it today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:46:22-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Today's better, yes. Then it's already in front of them Monday morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:46:29-04:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'd have gone down in person, but my passport expired and I haven't renewed it yet, so I'm not exactly traveling anywhere, and I was stuck at the house anyway. Doesn't matter. Just something I noticed this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:46:49-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Well, for this you only need the phone. Is there anything else about the street? Any ice, or is it just water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:47:01-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just water. It's been warm enough. If it gets cold tonight it could skim over, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:47:10-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll add that. If it freezes, that's a bigger concern for people driving through. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:47:19-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that's all. You have the address, the drain, the pictures, and the number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:47:28-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do. 280 Ayrault Street, Mr. Figueroa, standing water, clogged drain, photos available, callback 401-555-0157."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:47:36-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Thank you, Lorraine. I appreciate you being there on a Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:47:43-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Take care, and stay out of that road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-08T14:47:49-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
